2026-07-26T07:07:18.3575982Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-26T07:07:18.3723559Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-26T07:07:18.3724476Z i C:\Users\RUNNER~1\AppData\Local\Temp\RtmpQTTTFt/duckdb
2026-07-26T07:07:18.3725079Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-26T07:07:18.3725607Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-26T07:07:18.3726070Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-26T07:07:18.3726816Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-26T07:07:18.3727928Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-26T07:07:18.3729196Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-26T07:07:18.4181180Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-26T07:07:18.4343695Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-26T07:07:18.4937144Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-26T07:07:18.5219204Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
